%% 审核型活动：提交进入待审核 → 管理员批准时二次检查名额
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as 学生
    actor A as 管理员
    participant RS as RegistrationService
    participant AP as ApprovalRegistrationPolicy
    participant AS as ApprovalService
    participant CR as CapacityRule
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant EB as EventBus
    participant NS as NotificationService

    S->>RS: register(activity_id=2, student)
    RS->>AP: submit(context)
    AP-->>RS: PolicyDecision(status=pending)（待审核不占名额）
    RS->>DB: INSERT registration(status=pending)
    RS->>EB: publish(RegistrationSubmitted)
    EB->>NS: handle → 站内消息「报名已提交，等待审核」

    A->>AS: POST /admin/registrations/9/approve
    AS->>DB: 读取报名（必须为 pending）
    AS->>CR: ensure_available(activity, regs)
    alt 名额已满
        CR-->>AS: CapacityFullError（状态保持待审核）
        AS-->>A: 页面提示「名额已满，无法再通过新的报名」
    else 有空位
        AS->>DB: BEGIN → UPDATE status=approved → COMMIT
        AS->>EB: publish(RegistrationApproved)
        EB->>NS: handle → 站内消息「报名审核通过」+ 邮件
        NS-->>S: 通知到达
    end
